{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的短句拆分有时削弱了因果衔接，尤其 S08、S11，人物为什么从一种心理转向下一种心理，X 的完整句子交代得更顺。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的【】让每段心理转折都有醒目的抓手，短句也更适合边听音乐边扫读；感受词按音乐进程出现，减少了同屏信息争抢，同时让情绪、身体反应和音乐变化形成更细的对应。X 的完整句子在解释人物动机和因果关系时略胜一筹，但 Y 的重点识别、情绪递进和前后呼应整体更好，尤其是从怀念、动摇到接受矛盾并继续生活的过程，呈现得更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8829c4eb-eb41-4aac-a035-61c280f69cb6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194105203418Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:43:18.060624+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c5444010643d547939fd5702a921dc4a0077d3040becd45db9b72a12512baa9d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme